"comparison":"Both AMD and Intel disclose risks related to the uncertain trajectory and demand for AI products in the data center. AMD highlights that demand for its AI accelerators depends on customer utilization of generative AI, the trajectory of which is unknown. Similarly, Intel notes that AI markets are difficult to predict and that customer spend is shifting toward high-end GPUs, creating uncertainty for Intel's significant investments in AI data center products.",
