"comparison":"Both AMD and NVIDIA identify generative AI as a key driver of data center demand while emphasizing the unknown long-term trajectory of this technology. AMD states that demand for its AI accelerators depends on the extent to which customers utilize generative AI solutions and that their long-term trajectory is unknown. NVIDIA similarly notes that while generative AI models have driven increased demand for Data Center, their long-term trajectory is unknown, making it difficult to estimate the impact on revenue or forecasted demand.",
